  },
  {
    "id": 1009004060020,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "聞いてくださいっ！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900406/1009004060020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、今日はどんな話だ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009004060030,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "前にお話したヒーローショーです！\r\n行ってきましたー！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900406/1009004060030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もう終わったのかと思ってたよ\r\n公演、最近だったんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009004060040,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900406/1009004060040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうだった？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009004060050,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "スッゴくカッコよかったです！！！！！！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900406/1009004060050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははっ、めちゃくちゃ溜めたなぁ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009004060060,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "だって、だって！\r\nこの公演、スゴく特別だったんですっ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900406/1009004060060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009004060070,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "変身前も、変身後も、\r\nテレビの俳優さんとスーツアクターさんだったんですよ！！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900406/1009004060070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、おお……？\r\nそれってすごいのか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009004060080,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "スゴいんです！！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900406/1009004060080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009004060090,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ヒーローショーは色んなところであるから\r\n他の人がやってるんです",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900406/1009004060090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009004060100,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "だから、変身前の人が出てくることはあんまりなくて……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900406/1009004060100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009004060110,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "変身後も、テレビの人とはちがう人で……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900406/1009004060110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009004060120,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "でも、あたしが見に行ったのはそうじゃなくて、\r\nみなさんテレビの人なんです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900406/1009004060120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009004060130,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "他の人がやってるジャスティスⅤが\r\nニセモノとかじゃないんですけど……！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900406/1009004060130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009004060140,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ほんとに本物のジャスティスⅤが！　いました！！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900406/1009004060140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大興奮だな……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、確かにそうか",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "テレビシリーズの方がある上で、ショーもやるのは\r\n結構スケジュールが厳しいよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それこそ、デパートの屋上とかテーマパークで……\r\nみたいなショーもあるんだもんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ヒーローものって撮影がハードって聞いたこともあるし、\r\n他にも仕事はあるだろうし……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんな色んなところに出張してたら、\r\nご本人とマネージャーさんが大変そうだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009004060150,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900406/1009004060150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009004060160,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたしもお仕事をしてて、ちょっとだけわかるので、\r\n大変そうだな……って思いました！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900406/1009004060160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009004060170,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "今までやってきたお仕事が\r\nワーッて全部来ちゃったくらいかなって……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900406/1009004060170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははは、そこまでか\r\nひとりがこなせる量じゃないかもしれないなぁ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009004060180,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "やっぱり……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900406/1009004060180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009004060190,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "じゃあ、あたしがジャスティスⅤのみんなを見れたのは\r\nほんとにほんとにスゴいことなんだ……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900406/1009004060190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009004060200,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "～～～～～～～！！！",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900406/1009004060200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……うん\r\n果穂が俺に見せてくれる顔は、いつだってこうなんだよな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00459",
    "fg": "001922",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "fgEffect": "fade",
    "fgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "果穂の母",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんだから、\r\nあの子は思いっきり甘えちゃうんですね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00224",
    "fg": "fade_out",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "fgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（果穂がヒーローの話をしてくれるのは、\r\n信頼してくれているから）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（ヒーローとアイドルが似ているからやりたいって\r\nスカウトした時は話してくれたけど）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（あの時と今とでは、話の内容が全然違ってるって\r\nあんまり変化が自然だったから、気付いてなかった）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（ずっとヒーローの話ではあるけど、\r\n今は、果穂の生活に紐づいてる）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（本当、勘違いして思い込んで……\r\n馬鹿みたいだなぁ……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（いつの間にか、果穂にとって信じていい大人だって\r\n頼っていい相手だって、認識してもらっていた）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "頑張らなきゃなぁ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00001",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "id": 1009004060210,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "？\r\nプロデューサーさん、何をがんばるんですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100900406/1009004060210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "仕事かな！\r\n今以上にもっと、果穂のプロデューサーとして",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009004060220,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "！！\r\nあたしもっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900406/1009004060220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009004060230,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたしもお仕事もっともっともーっとがんばりますっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900406/1009004060230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、そうだな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ただし、果穂が果穂らしくいられるように\r\nなるべく、友達や家族と過ごせる時間は確保しつつだ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
